# seed: 24
# requires: hero_ready spell_learn spell_cast music_play
# requires-match: spell_cast caster=hero
# requires-match: spell_cast caster=monster
# Learn Health Weave in the normal Spells panel, then meet a random encounter, cast it once, and
# take a monster's cast back.
#
# CHANGED (Battle-2): the 21 "attack once, then press F to retreat before retaliation" legs are
# GONE. Under the original's FUN_00436c9d an offline ordinary encounter has no timer escape at
# all - DAT_00502b14 is 0 and the Tactics abandon dialog FUN_00447431 returns 0 offline - so F is
# refused with "You attempt to flee... but are dragged back" unless the 30 % interrupt of an
# attack already animating on the hero fires. Farming PP by retreating was only possible because
# the port's flee always succeeded, which was a documented deviation. This replay now plays the
# encounter out and leaves through that 30 % window, which is the original's own escape.
# tests/replay/gap_flee.rpl asserts the refusal and the escape on their own.
expect boot_menu 900
key RETURN
wait 30
# FUN_0041B891's own table (all.c:21078) has THREE states before the Well, not two:
#   1 main menu -> 2 "Where Do You Want To Play Today?" (splash, art\where.jpg, FUN_0041D31F)
#   2 -> 3 "Choose Your World" + the world list (art\chapter.jpg, FUN_0041D717)
#   3 -> take the highlighted row (msg 0x474) -> the Pick-a-Soul window
# The old port collapsed the splash; the three states are the original's, so the script
# spends one more RETURN on them. RETURN is the plan's keyboard shortcut for the click.
key RETURN
wait 30
key RETURN
wait 30
key n
wait 5
text GapBook
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key RETURN
expect hero_ready 300
expect map_enter 600
click 358 32
wait 3
click 110 44
wait 3
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key l
expect spell_learn 300
key ESCAPE
# Random encounter: cast Health Weave once, take a monster's cast, then leave through the
# original's 30 % interrupt window (FUN_00436c9d's `rand()%100 < 30`).
hold RIGHT 150
keydown DOWN
expect battle_start 1500
keyup DOWN
key s
shot /tmp/wos-gap-spell-menu.bmp
key DOWN
key RETURN
key a
wait 90
shot /tmp/wos-gap-spell-effect.bmp
expect spell_cast 600
expect spell_cast 600
shot /tmp/wos-gap-spell.bmp
key a
wait 30
key f
wait 2
key a
wait 30
key f
wait 2
